  "description": "ExpertPdf PDF to Text Converter extracts the text of PDF documents - all pages or a range - keeping the original layout or in reading order, and finds where words are on the pages.\n\nThis package contains the library for .NET Framework 2.0 to 4.8.1, .NET Core 2.0+ and .NET 5 to .NET 11 (through .NET Standard 2.0). It is the build for x86 and AnyCPU applications; for 64-bit applications use ExpertPdf.PdfToText.x64.\n\nFeatures\n- Extract the text of a whole document or a range of pages\n- Original layout or reading order; page break marks\n- Text positions (page, x, y, width, height) and text from an area of a page\n- Password protected documents; document information (title, author, page count)\n- From a file, a stream or a byte array",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.jpg",
  "id": "ExpertPdf.PdfToText",
